    Kashier -.->|inbound: signature-verified payment-result webhook\n(ADR-016 - narrow exception, not a general opening)| Core

    %% Explicitly out of V1 context
    OUT["Out of V1 context:\nParent · SMS · WhatsApp · Email ·\nany OTHER inbound 3rd-party\n(Kashier's webhook is the sole, ADR-016-approved exception)"]:::excluded

